# Lists and tasks

Regression fixture for two defects found in the 2026-08-03 carry-over audit:
task lists were dropped entirely, and nested list items were emitted before
their parent with no depth recorded.

Note the blank lines before each nested list. Djot requires them; without
one the child is parsed as lazy continuation text of the parent paragraph.

- parent item

  - child item

  - second child

    - grandchild

- another parent

1. first ordered

2. second ordered

   1. nested ordered

- [ ] an open task
- [x] a done task

- [ ] task with a [link](target.dj) in it

A closing paragraph.
